OL,3,AUnder-fives and pregnant women told to
OL,4,Aavoid runny eggs when eating out over
OL,5,Asalmonella risk
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the FSA said well-cooked eggs in
OL,8,Frestaurants, cafes and from takeaways
OL,9,Fwere fine to eat.
OL,11,FIt comes after the UK Health Security
OL,12,FAgency declared a national outbreak of
OL,13,Fsalmonella food poisoning after one
OL,14,Fperson died and hundreds more fell ill.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
